            "review_title": "Review at Michi Sushi",
            "review_text": "Stefano S\nLusiana, Italy1461 contributions\n0\nGreat food and amazing view\nApr 2023 • Couples\nNice little restaurant at the 7th floor of a building facing the Nguyen Hue walking street. The service is even a little bit too neglected and there were few very cute little dogs running everywhere, which isn’t too much hygienic. However, the presentation of the dishes has been very accurate and the food was great. The panorama in the evening is amazing with all those lights and colors. We had definitely a pleasant dinner.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 26, 2024",
